{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19128","headline":"夔州窦员外使君见示悼妓诗顾余尝识之因命同作 · 刘禹锡","name":"夔州窦员外使君见示悼妓诗顾余尝识之因命同作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前年曾见两鬟时，今日惊吟悼妓诗。\n凤管学成知有籍，龙媒欲换叹无期。\n空廊月照常行地，後院花开旧折枝。\n寂寞鱼山青草里，何人更立智琼祠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19128.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19128","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}